<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Minor rework on dashboard screen.

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Added keybind inside fling gui , added multi target and tracking in the fling gui.

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Custom attach.

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Fixed Fly not working on phone.]],1)createMessageCard(_homeLogs,_d65orv({18,19,107,28,110,13,20,125,106,114,18,5,111,30,98,17},{66,65,46,74,39}),[[<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Fixed Attach transitions! Attachments now lock correctly, preventing physics bugs from concurrent states.

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Added notification protection to explicitly block enabling multiple Attachments simultaneously.]],2)createMessageCard(_homeLogs,_d65orv({0,2,44,125,29,110,61,104,11,15,60,125,28},{79,78,104,56}),[[<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Updated GUI for Phone (Compact Side-Sheet & vertical thumb navigation dock).

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Added Click Teleport Tool in Movement so phone users can tap anywhere on screen to teleport.

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Dual Floating Pill on screen for Phone (mortal logo to toggle script visibility, 2nd icon to toggle on-screen action buttons visibility).

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> New page in Visuals (Camera & Light): Adjust contrast, exposure, saturation, FOV, time, and 360° spinning reset buttons.

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> New character animations added: Cute, Kawai, Jotaro, Dio, Sword, Realistic man, Sleepy zombie, Survivor, Dizzy, Dumb.]],3)createMessageCard(_homeLogs,_d65orv({36,42,112,104,57,70,97,125,47,39,96,104,56},{107,102,52,45}),[[<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Adonis anti-cheat bypass added and added Anti-Kick in anti-stuffs to prevent moderation kicks after execution in games like ( krishna mandir and etc games) you can execute script in many more games rn.

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Tweaks in Re-anim GUI.

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Fixed display name isn't visible of players when turning on re-anim.

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Made music player gui better.

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Shifted VC BYPASS to defense category.

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Removed some useless features.

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Added script-users activity in social category.]],4)createMessageCard(_homeLogs,_d65orv({56,2,15,47,100,59,60,20,108,50,125,41,56,4,9,52},{121,80,76,103,45,109}),[[<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Fixed Superman fly.

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Made chat spam better.

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Added Skydestroyer in troll category.

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Added fling GUI in troll category.

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Added anti fling in defense category.

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Added touch fling in movement > Physics category.

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Added music player (still in dev) in the social category.

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Themed the entire script UI to a vibrant Green and properly colored the Big Baseplate (F1).

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Completely re-wrote Friend Activity image loading to pull native, high-quality game thumbnails.

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Fixed major logic bugs in Friend Activity where users idling on the website were marked as playing.

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Added robust executor fallback for Friend Activity so friends with missing data show gracefully as "In Game".

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Fixed a critical compiler crash (Local variables limit exceeded) by cleaning up memory allocations.

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Built dynamic Custom Keybind Boxes for "Toggle Interface" and "Minimize Window" that auto-resize based on key names.

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Redesigned Basic Controls guide with explicit functions for Mac buttons (Red=Close, Yellow=Minimize, Green=Resize).

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Stacked Discord Integration Cards (Developer & mortal Discord) with quick-copy buttons.

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Fixed a UI bug in Activity that caused the "No friends currently in-game" text to overlap onto the sub-tab bar.

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Completely redesigned Update Logs & Shortcuts as premium System Message cards featuring the mortal logo, fading gradients, and yellow accents.

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Added a state-saving Auto-Execute toggle for Shaders, Terrains, and Environments.

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Increased thickness of the separator lines between navigation icons for better visibility.

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Sped up the running UIGradient strokes across the sub-tab menus for a fluid animation.

